# 🧪 Automation Testing & QA Certifications
### Continuous Learning in Test Automation

This repository documents my learning journey in **Software Testing and Test Automation**, with a focus on Selenium, Python-based automation, Playwright, and Robot Framework.

I have completed three industry-oriented courses through Coursera, progressively building my knowledge from Selenium fundamentals to modern test automation frameworks.

